    'Build interactive lessons with video, activities and resources.': '通过视频、活动和资源构建互动课程。',
    'Share instantly with learners, classes, groups and audiences.': '即时分享给学习者、班级、群组和受众。',
    'Deliver active, self-paced, classroom and blended experiences.': '支持主动学习、自主学习、课堂教学和混合式学习。',
    'Bring learners, publishers, teams and communities together.': '连接学习者、发布者、团队与社区。',
    'See progress, results, participation and learning outcomes.': '查看学习进度、结果、参与度和学习成效。',
    'Update, duplicate, adapt and republish content without rebuilding.': '无需从头制作，即可更新、复制、调整并重新发布内容。',
    'Not another collection of separate tools.': '不再是一堆彼此割裂的工具。',
